*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.tga binary
*.psd binary
*.exr binary
*.hdr binary
*.tif binary
*.fbx binary
*.glb binary
*.blend binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
